<title>POLAND: Polish stocks end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish stocks end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two stocks fell, two rose and five were flat in five-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The remaining 12 stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.4 percent to 137 zlotys in a 5.3-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
